  "title": "Ingevity included in TIME America’s Best Companies 2026 list",
  "summary": "NORTH CHARLESTON, S.C., August 18, 2026 – Ingevity Corporation (NYSE:NGVT) today announced it has been named to TIME’s list of America’s Best Companies 2026. This award is presented in collaboration with Statista, the global statistics portal and industry ranking provider. “This recognition belongs to our employees, whose expertise, dedication and commitment drive our success every […]",
